<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-09T02:24:39.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "intro-lesson-1-intro-to-html-825380ac-c8c6-49a7-8072-f30a5d6e451f",
        "text": "Have you ever wondered how websites are made? Every page you visit on the internet, from your favorite social media site to an online game, starts with a special language.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6fa43bf022305c435fc3d2c77f9dc274-intro-lesson-1-intro-to-html-panel-1-d2577a3d-22aa-4e14-8af2-299c71486fd4.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-lesson-1-intro-to-html-81de4460-bcb0-4da1-b150-911cba87a548",
        "text": "That language is called **HTML**! It stands for **HyperText Markup Language**. Think of HTML as the *backbone* or *skeleton* of every webpage you see.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/3e60d04101c70bbfdcd6785a4563fdb7-intro-lesson-1-intro-to-html-panel-2-2d1ac326-d181-4892-ace0-e91253246d99.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-lesson-1-intro-to-html-b293fd8f-b4af-4170-b22c-2c141839c5c1",
        "text": "HTML tells your web browser how to organize all the content on a page. It dictates where the headings go, where paragraphs are, and where images should appear.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/1c23b3fbaa556c7125b5e80fb34f3e6f-intro-lesson-1-intro-to-html-panel-3-147b0d18-15a1-4d68-a11a-fc1858710307.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-lesson-1-intro-to-html-641a13b8-4281-4a11-bcf6-49421a78e527",
        "text": "HTML uses special markers called 'tags', like `<p>` for a paragraph or `<h1>` for a main heading. These tags group content into 'elements', which are the basic building blocks of your page.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/4543eb58396f97c6a56a022caf01b6bc-intro-lesson-1-intro-to-html-panel-4-c22564b3-9f8e-41b3-a654-b3180861d09d.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Introduce what HTML is, its role as the backbone of web pages, and the concept of tags and elements."
  },
  "published": true,
